{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightcrawler</strong> is a minimalist retrowave arcade about the state of flow.<br>You get an endless road, a sunset, and synthwave. The game sets one clear rule: stay on track and pass through the gates. Miss one \u2014 the run is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How it works</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clipping zones:</strong> align your path and pass through the gates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic difficulty:</strong> the longer you ride, the faster the road and the narrower the gaps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure focus:</strong> no distractions \u2014 just you, the motorcycle, and the rhythm of the road.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere:</strong> neon aesthetics and a synthwave soundtrack create a meditative yet intense flow.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game offers</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Endless road with meditative gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Atmospheric synthwave soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Neon, sunset, and retrofuturistic aesthetics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Simple controls \u2014 relax and enjoy the ride.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u041d\u0430\u0447\u0430\u043b\u043e","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3931960/422bd7872669da1ea9ad2443d57b05eef147ebb8.jpg"},{"name":"\u0423\u043f\u043e\u0440\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u043d\u0435\u0443\u0434\u0430\u0447\u043d\u0438\u043a","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3931960/97681687870d47768ab2406e2dc66a4d5291960b.jpg"},{"name":"\u041a\u043e\u0440\u043e\u043b\u044c \u0432\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0442","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3931960/ace90675e28d418